# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw_shaded_lightcone}"
msgstr "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw_shaded_lightcone}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each noisy box is shaded by the bound on the errors occurring there: bright means a large bound, and\n"
"a box fading into the background means its errors have little effect on the observable. Those faded\n"
"boxes are the candidates for dropping from the mitigated noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bawat maingay na box ay may shade ayon sa bound sa mga error na nangyayari roon: ang maliwanag ay nangangahulugang malaking bound, at\n"
"ang box na naglalaho sa background ay nangangahulugang kaunti ang epekto ng mga error nito sa observable. Ang mga naglahong\n"
"box na iyon ang mga kandidato para alisin sa mitigated na noise model.\n"

